WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
Homemade meatballs in tomato sauce.

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.840
I'll reveal what I add at the end to the red sauce,

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.800
and you tell me whether you knew about it.

4
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.140
To the ground meat we add onion and garlic,

5
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.080
an egg, breadcrumbs, spices and a little oil.

6
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.900
We knead all this well into a firm mass,

7
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.640
and then form balls.

8
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.020
I always fry them in lard on both sides,

9
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.060
until they brown.

10
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.400
Then I take them out,

11
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.340
and then add flour and ground paprika.

12
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.840
(unclear) I pour in water and add homemade Barilla sauce

13
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.000
without preservatives, basil flavor.

14
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.860
And the secret of any red sauce — a little sugar.